# hermes-* rename + context-cap recipe (2026-07-19)

User wanted ALL local LLMs renamed to a `hermes-*` scheme with explicit context caps
baked in (num_ctx), full GPU offload (num_gpu = layer count), thinking off (per-call).

## Bake commands (ollama_fit.py, ext4 store required for bake)
```bash
cd /home/admin1/income-work/ollama-fit
# M2 qwen3.6:27b-q4_K_M -> hermes-qwen (193K, 66 layers)
python3 -u ollama_fit.py --host http://192.168.1.15:11434 \
  --model qwen3.6:27b-q4_K_M bake --ctx 197632 --nl 66 --name hermes-qwen
# M2 ornith:35b-q4_K_M -> hermes-35b (128K, 42 layers)
python3 -u ollama_fit.py --host http://192.168.1.15:11434 \
  --model ornith:35b-q4_K_M bake --ctx 131072 --nl 42 --name hermes-35b
# M3 qwen3.5:4b-q4_K_M -> hermes-4b (65K, 34 layers)  [Windows Ollama host]
python3 -u ollama_fit.py --host http://192.168.1.9:11434 \
  --model qwen3.5:4b-q4_K_M bake --ctx 65536 --nl 34 --name hermes-4b
# M1 ornith:9b -> hermes-9b (128K, 34 layers)  [builder host]
python3 -u ollama_fit.py --host http://192.168.1.8:11434 \
  --model ornith:9b bake --ctx 131072 --nl 34 --name hermes-9b
```

## Context caps (user-specified)
- ornith family: 128K hard cap
- M3 LLM (4b): 65K
- M2 ornith: 128K
- M2 qwen3.6: 193K

## Verify 0-spill at capped ctx (fast, single load)
```bash
python3 -u ollama_fit.py --host http://192.168.1.15:11434 --model hermes-qwen:latest bench --ctx 197632
python3 -u ollama_fit.py --host http://192.168.1.15:11434 --model hermes-35b:latest bench --ctx 131072
```
bench loads at the given ctx; success = 0-spill (a spill/OOM would 500). TPS prints
but the user said DON'T lead with TPS@65K -- report "sits at 0-spill at capped ctx" first.

## Gotchas
- `bake` with no `--name` REBAKES the source model in place (overwrites its own
  num_ctx/num_gpu). Use `--name` to create a NEW named model.
- M3 is Windows Ollama; hermes-4b bake "succeeded" but the model failed to LOAD
  (CUDA OOM even at 4K) -- M3's GPU is too small for 4b full-offload. Needs the
  user's M3 GPU spec before setting a working cap. Don't force num_gpu=34 blindly.
- Thinking off is NOT baked (0.32.1 rejects PARAMETER think). Enforce per-call
  (`think:false` / Hermes reasoning_effort:none).
